  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A refused stored plan on the admin Rules path emits DecisionPlanRefused with the reason and increments ontology.decisionplan.refused once with the reason tag; the comment is true; test fails on origin/master.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Authoring: PlanMalformed, UnknownAction and a non-next-step code in nextSteps each get a distinct plain sentence with no internal code; the lane case keeps the lane sentence; ReasonCode set consistently with the sibling branches.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">SignalReevaluationJob comment describes the OrdinalIgnoreCase order; no behaviour change.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build, filtered tests, full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
